<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 200s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 3rd century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 200s, 205 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 41 were founded and 62 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Roman Empire, the Funan and the Teotihuacan.</p></header>
